# Lines must stay LF everywhere. GitHub's windows-latest runners have
# core.autocrlf=true, so without this a checkout rewrites every tracked file
# to CRLF and `biome check` fails on formatting alone — a red gate that never
# reproduces on a macOS/Linux dev machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must not be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
